              "content": "Check for Updates… opens the update sheet and checks at once. It works the same whether or not a background check already ran.",
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Dr0gU",
              "name": "Text",
              "fill": "$muted-fg",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "What’s New in Newjen reopens the notes for the version you run. Release Notes on GitHub opens the full history in the browser.",
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Ldq6a",
              "name": "Text",
              "fill": "$muted-fg",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "No Settings window exists, so there is no auto-update switch. Newjen checks once an hour and never restarts on its own.",
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "sAgZe",
              "name": "Text",
              "fill": "$muted-fg",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "About Newjen shows the version, the commit and how it was installed (Homebrew or download).",
              "fontFamily": "$font",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
